        {
          "ref": "p0178#2",
          "kind": "cap",
          "label": "图 136",
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "图 136"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0178#3",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "cont": true,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "第一个面同样的光通量照在这个平面上. 如果第二个平面和",
            "第一平面成 $\\alpha$ 角，那末从中心光源射在它上面的光线的入射",
            "角同样等于 $\\alpha$. 第二个平面的面积等于 $\\Delta S$. 从图形中很容易",
            "看出，两个平面都具有同一宽度 $a$，但长度 $b$ 和 $b_0$ 不同，并",
            "且因为",
            "$\\frac{b_0}{b}=\\cos\\alpha$"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0178#4",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "所以",
            "$\\frac{\\Delta S_0}{\\Delta S}=\\frac{ab_0}{ab}=\\cos\\alpha$"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0178#5",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "当光通量均为 $\\Delta\\Phi$ 时，两个平面的照度就将不同：",
            "$E=\\frac{\\Delta\\Phi}{\\Delta S}$，　$E_0=\\frac{\\Delta\\Phi}{\\Delta S_0}$"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0178#6",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "于是",
            "$\\frac{E}{E_0}=\\frac{\\Delta S_0}{\\Delta S}=\\cos\\alpha$"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0178#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "因此，与光线倾斜的面上的照度 $E$ 与光线垂直的面上的照度",
            "$E_0$ 有如下的联系：",
            "$E=E_0\\cos\\alpha$ (6.6)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0178#8",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "这就是说，表面的照度与光线入射角的余弦成正比."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0178#9",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "综合得出的结果，可以总结出一条一般的规律."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0178#10",
          "kind": "foot",
          "label": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "• 168 •"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
